---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<section class="fts" id="free-tools-strip">
  <div class="fts-inner">

    <div class="fts-header">
      <span class="fts-label"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#D4A931" aria-hidden="true" style="margin-right:6px;vertical-align:middle"><path d="M12 2l2.4 7.4H22l-6.2 4.5 2.4 7.4L12 17l-6.2 4.3 2.4-7.4L2 9.4h7.6z"/></svg>Free Diagnostic Tools</span>
      <h2 class="fts-heading">Not sure what's wrong?<br><em>Start with a free 2-minute check.</em></h2>
      <p class="fts-sub">Used by 2,400+ Chicago homeowners to catch problems before they become expensive emergencies.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="fts-grid">

      <a href="/services/chimney-repair-rebuilding#chimney-risk-score" class="fts-card">
        <div class="fts-accent"></div>
        <div class="fts-card-top">
          <div class="fts-badge">Chimney</div>
          <h3 class="fts-name">Chimney Risk Score</h3>
          <p class="fts-pain">A cracked chimney crown or loose bricks is a fire hazard — most homeowners don't find out until winter.</p>
          <p class="fts-solve">12-point structural check. Know your real danger level in 2 minutes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fts-card-bottom">
          <blockquote class="fts-testimonial" cite="https://www.google.com/maps/place/All+Masonry+Services">
            <p class="fts-quote">"Scored an 8. Called AMS — two bricks near the cap were completely loose. Glad I caught it."</p>
            <cite class="fts-reviewer"><span aria-hidden="true">James T. · Naperville, IL </span><span aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span><span class="fts-cite-hidden">James T., Naperville, IL</span></cite>
          </blockquote>
          <div class="fts-meta">
            <span class="fts-users">847 homeowners used this</span>
            <span class="fts-cta-btn">Start Free Check</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="/services/damaged-brick-replacement#brick-damage-counter" class="fts-card">
        <div class="fts-accent"></div>
        <div class="fts-card-top">
          <div class="fts-badge">Brick Repair</div>
          <h3 class="fts-name">Count Your Damaged Bricks</h3>
          <p class="fts-pain">One missing brick lets water into your wall — one Chicago winter later, the repair cost triples.</p>
          <p class="fts-solve">Enter your brick counts. Get a line-item repair estimate with urgency rating.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fts-card-bottom">
          <blockquote class="fts-testimonial" cite="https://www.google.com/maps/place/All+Masonry+Services">
            <p class="fts-quote">"Estimate said $840–$1,100. Contractor quoted $980. Saved me from getting lowballed."</p>
            <cite class="fts-reviewer"><span aria-hidden="true">Maria S. · Elmhurst, IL </span><span aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span><span class="fts-cite-hidden">Maria S., Elmhurst, IL</span></cite>
          </blockquote>
          <div class="fts-meta">
            <span class="fts-users">1,100+ homeowners used this</span>
            <span class="fts-cta-btn">Get My Estimate</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="/services/brick-installation#brick-estimator" class="fts-card">
        <div class="fts-accent"></div>
        <div class="fts-card-top">
          <div class="fts-badge">New Installation</div>
          <h3 class="fts-name">Brick Project Estimator</h3>
          <p class="fts-pain">Contractors quote high when they know you haven't done your homework — walk in with the real numbers.</p>
          <p class="fts-solve">Brick count, material cost & labor range for Chicago Metro {currentYear}.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fts-card-bottom">
          <blockquote class="fts-testimonial" cite="https://www.google.com/maps/place/All+Masonry+Services">
            <p class="fts-quote">"Had zero idea what a brick patio should cost. This gave me a real number before I talked to anyone."</p>
            <cite class="fts-reviewer"><span aria-hidden="true">Derek M. · Hinsdale, IL </span><span aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span><span class="fts-cite-hidden">Derek M., Hinsdale, IL</span></cite>
          </blockquote>
          <div class="fts-meta">
            <span class="fts-users">620+ homeowners used this</span>
            <span class="fts-cta-btn">Calculate My Project</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.fts {
  background: #1A1A1A;
  padding: 88px 0;
  border-top: 2px solid #2D2D2D;
}

.fts-inner {
  max-width: 1280px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 80px;
}

/* HEADER */
.fts-header {
  margin-bottom: 52px;
}

.fts-label {
  display: inline-block;
  font-family: 'Satoshi', sans-serif;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #D4A931;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.fts-heading {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 42px);
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #FFFFFF;
  line-height: 1.15;
  margin: 0 0 16px 0;
}
.fts-heading em {
  font-style: italic;
  font-weight: 400;
  color: #D4A931;
}

.fts-sub {
  font-family: 'Satoshi', sans-serif;
  font-size: 15px;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin: 0;
  max-width: 520px;
}

/* GRID */
.fts-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 24px;
  align-items: stretch;
}

/* CARD */
.fts-card {
  background: #FFFFFF;
  border: 2px solid #D8D2C8;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: border-color 250ms ease, box-shadow 250ms ease, transform 250ms ease;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.fts-card:hover {
  border-color: #D4A931;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.10);
  transform: translateY(-4px);
}
.fts-card:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid #D4A931;
  outline-offset: 2px;
}

.fts-accent {
  width: 100%;
  height: 3px;
  background: #D4A931;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.fts-card-top {
  padding: 24px 24px 20px;
  flex: 1;
}

.fts-badge {
  display: inline-block;
  font-family: 'Satoshi', sans-serif;
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #D4A931;
  border: 2px solid #D4A931;
  padding: 3px 8px;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}

.fts-name {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: 20px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #1A1A1A;
  line-height: 1.2;
  margin: 0 0 14px 0;
}

.fts-pain {
  font-family: 'Satoshi', sans-serif;
  font-size: 13px;
  color: #4A4A4A;
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin: 0 0 10px 0;
}

.fts-solve {
  font-family: 'Satoshi', sans-serif;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #1A1A1A;
  line-height: 1.55;
  margin: 0;
}

/* CARD BOTTOM */
.fts-card-bottom {
  border-top: 1px solid #E8E4DC;
  padding: 18px 24px 22px;
  background: #FAFAF8;
}

.fts-testimonial {
  border-left: 3px solid #D4A931;
  padding-left: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.fts-testimonial cite { font-style: normal; }
.fts-cite-hidden {
  position: absolute;
  width: 1px;
  height: 1px;
  padding: 0;
  margin: -1px;
  overflow: hidden;
  clip: rect(0,0,0,0);
  white-space: nowrap;
  border: 0;
}

.fts-quote {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 13px;
  color: #1A1A1A;
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin: 0 0 6px 0;
}

.fts-reviewer {
  font-family: 'Satoshi', sans-serif;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #8B8070;
  display: block;
}

/* META ROW */
.fts-meta {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 8px;
}

.fts-users {
  font-family: 'Satoshi', sans-serif;
  font-size: 11px;
  color: #8B8070;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.fts-cta-btn {
  font-family: 'Satoshi', sans-serif;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #1A1A1A;
  background: #D4A931;
  padding: 6px 12px;
  display: inline-block;
  white-space: nowrap;
  transition: background 200ms ease;
}
.fts-card:hover .fts-cta-btn {
  background: #B8932A;
}

/* scroll animations handled by GSAP section-transitions.ts */
/* hover preserved */
.fts-card:hover {
  border-color: #D4A931;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.10);
  transform: translateY(-4px);
}

/* TABLET */
@media (max-width: 1100px) {
  .fts-inner { padding: 0 40px; }
  .fts-grid { gap: 16px; }
  .fts-name { font-size: 18px; }
}

/* TABLET PORTRAIT */
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .fts { padding: 64px 0; }
  .fts-header { margin-bottom: 40px; }
}

/* MOBILE */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .fts { padding: 56px 0; }
  .fts-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px; }
  .fts-heading { font-size: clamp(24px, 6vw, 32px); }
  .fts-sub { max-width: 100%; }
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .fts-inner { padding: 0 20px; }
  .fts-card-top { padding: 20px 20px 16px; }
  .fts-card-bottom { padding: 16px 20px 18px; }
  .fts-name { font-size: 17px; }
  .fts-meta { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; }
  .fts-cta-btn { width: 100%; text-align: center; padding: 8px 12px; }
}
</style>

